+// browser: Input.probeMovementPersona: the hand the browser derives from a
+// seed, every field, for a test that compares the derived persona bit for
+// bit. Without a seed it is this process's own persona, the one its drags
+// move with. Every double goes out as the persona holds it.
+Response InputHandler::ProbeMovementPersona(
+    std::optional<std::string> seed,
+    std::string* seed_used,
+    double* speed_factor,
+    double* curvature_bias,
+    double* tremor_amplitude,
+    double* tremor_frequency_center,
